<title>ITALY: Italian M2 grew avge 2.8 pct in qtr end-Dec.</title>
<headline>Italian M2 grew avge 2.8 pct in qtr end-Dec.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian money supply as measured by M2 grew an adjusted average 2.8 percent year-on-year in the three months to end-December compared with an average growth of 3.2 percent in the three months to end-November, the Bank of Italy said in a statement.</p>
</text>
